NOTE ON SCOPE

This project ships no MobaXterm code. It is a standalone tool that rewrites
user-interface text inside an executable the user already possesses.

MobaXterm is commercial, closed-source software developed by MobaTech. This
tool does not decompile functionality, does not remove features, and does not
bypass any licensing or activation mechanism. Users are responsible for
complying with MobaTech's license terms for their own use.
